{"id":"justement","lemma":"justement","pos":"adv","rank":1083,"glosses":["precisely, exactly; accurately","just (moments ago, recently), just then","actually, at that very moment"],"ipa":"/ʒys.tə.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/62/Fr-justement.ogg/Fr-justement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"J'étais justement ici hier.","en":"I was just here yesterday.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"here"},{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"Je venais justement te voir.","en":"I was just on my way to see you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to see"}]},{"text":"Je pensais justement à un nouveau travail.","en":"I was just thinking of a new job.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"new, novel"},{"g":"work"}]},{"text":"J'allais justement dire la même chose.","en":"I was just about to say the same thing.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},null,{"g":"to say, to tell"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"same"},{"g":"thing"}]},{"text":"C'est justement ça, le plaisir !","en":"That's the fun of it.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"pleasure"}]}]}